flowchart TB
    subgraph enqueue异步
        E1["call.enqueue(callback)"] --> E2["OkHttp 线程池执行"]
        E2 --> E3["解析 Response"]
        E3 --> E4["Handler 切主线程"]
        E4 --> E5["callback.onResponse"]
    end

    subgraph execute同步
        X1["call.execute()"] --> X2["当前线程阻塞"]
        X2 --> X3["解析 Response"]
        X3 --> X4["直接返回 Response<br/>无 Callback"]
    end

    W["⚠️ execute 不能在主线程调用"]
    X1 -.-> W
